Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.79,0:00:03.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here you go. Pad Thai, no peanuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.79,0:00:03.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给你 泰式炒面 没有花生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.17,0:00:04.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Does it have peanut oil?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.17,0:00:04.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那有花生油吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.59,0:00:05.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.59,0:00:05.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不确定
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:09.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Everyone keep an eye on Howard in case he starts to swell up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大家都盯着霍华德 别让他肿了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.93,0:00:13.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Since it's not bee season, you can have my epinephrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.93,0:00:13.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}既然现在还没到拼字大赛的时候 你可以用我的肾上腺素
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.64,0:00:16.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Any chopsticks? -Don't need chopsticks, this is Thai food.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.64,0:00:16.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-有筷子吗？ -不用筷子 这是泰餐
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.52,0:00:17.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.52,0:00:17.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.02,0:00:21.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thailand has had the fork since the latter half of the 19th century.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.02,0:00:21.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}泰国从19世纪后半叶开始 就使用餐叉了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.31,0:00:25.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They don't put the fork in their mouth, they use it to put the food on a spoon...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.31,0:00:25.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有趣的是 他们不会把餐叉放嘴里 而是用它把食物放到勺子上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.23,0:00:27.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which then goes into their mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.23,0:00:27.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后再把勺子送进嘴里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.61,0:00:30.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ask him for a napkin, I dare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.61,0:00:30.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我猜你不敢问他要餐巾纸吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:31.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[KNOCKING ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.49,0:00:32.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.49,0:00:32.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我去开门
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:35.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do I look puffy? I feel puffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.12,0:00:35.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是不是肿了？我感觉自己肿了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.74,0:00:38.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, Leonard. -Oh, hi, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.74,0:00:38.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 莱纳德 -你好 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.37,0:00:39.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Am I interrupting? -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.37,0:00:39.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我没有打扰到你吧？ -没有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:41.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}SHELDON: You're not swelling, Howard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.62,0:00:41.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你没肿 霍华德
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:43.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}HOWARD: No, look at my fingers, they're like Vienna sausages.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.12,0:00:43.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 你们看我的手指 它们就像维也纳香肠
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:47.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Sounds like you have company. -They're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:47.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-貌似你有客人 -反正他们哪也不会去的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.34,0:00:51.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you're coming home from work. That's great. How was work?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.34,0:00:51.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你下班回家了 真好 工作怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know, it's a Cheesecake Factory...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道的 我在芝乐坊工作
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:55.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...people order cheesecake and I bring it to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:55.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谁要是点芝士蛋糕 我负责给他们送去就行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.72,0:01:00.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So you kind of act as like a carbohydrate delivery system?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.72,0:01:00.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这跟碳水化合物传送系统比较像
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.69,0:01:04.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, call it whatever you want, I get minimum wage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.69,0:01:04.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 随便你怎么说吧 我只领最低工资
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:06.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:06.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:08.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was wondering if you could help me out--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:08.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在想你能不能帮我…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.90,0:01:10.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yes. -Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.90,0:01:10.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}能
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.20,0:01:13.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, great, I'm having some furniture delivered...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.20,0:01:13.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的 很好 明天会有人给我送家具
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:16.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and I may not be here, so, oh--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:16.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我可能不在家 所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.99,0:01:18.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.99,0:01:18.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.16,0:01:21.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SPEAKS IN RUSSIAN]
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.62,0:01:23.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.62,0:01:23.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Haven't you ever been told how beautiful you are in flawless Russian?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是否曾有讲一口流利俄语的人夸你漂亮？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.34,0:01:29.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No, I haven't. -Get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.34,0:01:29.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不 没有 -那你慢慢习惯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.51,0:01:32.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I probably won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.51,0:01:32.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯 或许我不会习惯的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.26,0:01:34.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, Sheldon. -Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.26,0:01:34.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 谢尔顿 -嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.47,0:01:36.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Raj.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.47,0:01:36.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 拉吉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.64,0:01:39.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Still not talking to me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.64,0:01:39.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还是不肯跟我说话？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.64,0:01:41.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't take it personally, it's his pathology.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.64,0:01:41.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你别往心里去 这是他的老毛病了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.85,0:01:44.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-He can't talk to women. -He can't talk to attractive women.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.85,0:01:44.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-他不敢跟女人说话 -他不敢跟漂亮女人说话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.81,0:01:47.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or in your case, a cheesecake-scented goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.81,0:01:47.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或者说 一个浑身芝士味的女神
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.77,0:01:50.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-There's gonna be some furniture delivered? -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.77,0:01:50.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-有人会给你送家具？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.61,0:01:54.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If it gets here and I'm not here, could you sign for it and put it in?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.61,0:01:54.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果明天家具到的时候我不在 你能帮我签字 然后放屋里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.36,0:01:56.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Yeah, no problem. -Great, here's my spare key.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.36,0:01:56.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-好 没问题 -好极了 这是我的备用钥匙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.87,0:01:58.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.87,0:01:58.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.87,0:02:01.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Penny, wait. -Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.87,0:02:01.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-佩妮 等等 -怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.41,0:02:03.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Um....
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.37,0:02:06.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you don't have any other plans...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.37,0:02:06.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你没什么安排
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.21,0:02:09.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...do you wanna join us for Thai food and a Superman movie marathon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.21,0:02:09.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}要不要跟我们一起吃泰餐 然后看超人电影马拉松？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.55,0:02:12.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A marathon? Wow, how many Superman movies are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.55,0:02:12.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}马拉松？你们有多少部超人电影？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.76,0:02:15.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.76,0:02:15.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在开玩笑 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.80,0:02:18.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I do like the one where Lois Lane falls from the helicopter...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.80,0:02:18.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我确实喜欢露易丝莱恩 从直升机上面掉下去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:19.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and Superman catches her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.68,0:02:19.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后被超人接住那一部
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.14,0:02:22.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Which one was that? -One.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.14,0:02:22.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这是哪一部来着？ -第一部
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.14,0:02:26.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You realize that scene was rife with scientific inaccuracy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.14,0:02:26.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道那个场景不符合科学事实吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.73,0:02:28.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I know, men can't fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.73,0:02:28.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 我知道 人是不会飞的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.65,0:02:30.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, let's assume that they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.65,0:02:30.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 假设人可以飞
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.99,0:02:33.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Lois Lane is falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.99,0:02:33.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}露易丝莱恩从高空坠下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:35.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Accelerating at an initial rate of 32 feet per second.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:35.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以每秒大概10米的初始速度 做自由落体加速运动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.03,0:02:39.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Superman swoops down to save her by reaching out two arms of steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.03,0:02:39.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}超人冲到她身下 伸出两条钢铁般的手臂接住她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.24,0:02:40.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Miss Lane, who is now traveling...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.24,0:02:40.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱恩小姐 她此时的速度
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:43.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...at approximately 120 miles an hour, hits them...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:43.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大概是每小时193公里 等她猛撞上超人的手臂后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.75,0:02:46.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and is immediately sliced into three equal pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.75,0:02:46.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一定会被切成三等分段
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:51.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unless Superman matches her speed and decelerates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.04,0:02:51.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除非超人赶上她的速度并减速
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.59,0:02:53.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In what space, sir? In what space?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.59,0:02:53.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有时间吗 先生？他还有时间吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:54.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's 2 feet above the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她离地面都不到一米了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.51,0:02:58.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If he really loved her, he'd let her hit the pavement.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.51,0:02:58.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果他真的爱她 就会让她摔到人行道上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It would be a more merciful death. -That doesn't--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:03:00.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这样至少能留个全尸 -这不…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.76,0:03:04.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, your entire argument is predicated on the assumption...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.76,0:03:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 你这套理论 都是建立在一个假设上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.68,0:03:07.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that Superman's flight is a feat of strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.68,0:03:07.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也就是超人的飞行很有冲击力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.19,0:03:08.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you listening to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.19,0:03:08.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你听听你在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.77,0:03:10.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Superman's flight is a feat of strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.77,0:03:10.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}超人的飞行当然很有冲击力
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.11,0:03:13.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}An extension of his ability to leap buildings...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.11,0:03:13.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是他跳跃高楼的能力的延伸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.53,0:03:15.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...an ability he derives from exposure to sun--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.53,0:03:15.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是他从阳光中获取的能力…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.82,0:03:17.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How does he fly at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.82,0:03:17.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那他晚上怎么还能飞？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.86,0:03:19.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A combination of the moon's solar reflection...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.86,0:03:19.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}月亮反射了太阳的光
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.16,0:03:23.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and the energy storage capacity of Kryptonian skin cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.16,0:03:23.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再加上氪星球人的皮肤细胞 可以储藏能量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:26.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just gonna go wash up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:26.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我去洗漱了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.46,0:03:28.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have 2600 comic books in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.46,0:03:28.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我屋里有2600本漫画书
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.46,0:03:32.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I challenge you to find a single reference to Kryptonian skin cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.46,0:03:32.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你倒是去找找哪一本提到了 氪星球人的皮肤细胞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.21,0:03:34.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Challenge accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.21,0:03:34.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}找就找
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:38.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're locked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:38.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们被锁在门外了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.88,0:03:41.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Also, the pretty girl left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.88,0:03:41.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有 那个漂亮姑娘走了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.87,0:04:07.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.87,0:04:07.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:10.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Her apartment's on the fourth floor, elevator is broken, you're gonna--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:10.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她住四层 但电梯坏了 你们得…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.62,0:04:13.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, you're just gonna be done? Okay, cool, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.62,0:04:13.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们这样就算完事儿了？ 好吧 没问题 谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.63,0:04:18.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I guess we'll just bring it up ourselves. -I hardly think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.63,0:04:18.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-看来我们只能自己搬上去了 -还是算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.09,0:04:20.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.09,0:04:20.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:22.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, we don't have a dolly...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:22.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们没有手推车
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.43,0:04:26.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or lifting belts, or any measurable upper-body strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.43,0:04:26.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也没有升降运送带 或者强悍的上肢力量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.77,0:04:29.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We don't need strength. We're physicists.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.77,0:04:29.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们不用靠蛮力 我们是物理学家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.19,0:04:31.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We are the intellectual descendants of Archimedes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.19,0:04:31.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们是阿基米德的精英后代
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.69,0:04:34.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Give me a fulcrum and a lever and I can move the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.69,0:04:34.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给我一个杠杆和一个支点 我就能撬动地球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.40,0:04:37.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's just a matter-- I don't have this! I do not have this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.40,0:04:37.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这只是…要倒了…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.03,0:04:41.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Archimedes would be so proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.03,0:04:41.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}阿基米德一定很骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:48.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you have any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:48.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有什么主意吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.46,0:04:51.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but they all involve a Green Lantern and a power ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.46,0:04:51.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 但都需要绿灯侠和能量指环
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.08,0:04:56.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Easy. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.08,0:04:56.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}慢点…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.22,0:05:02.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Now we've got an inclined plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.22,0:05:02.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好了 现在有了斜面
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:06.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Force required to lift is reduced by the sine of the angle of the stairs...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:06.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所需力气会根据楼梯的正弦值变小
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.31,0:05:08.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...call it 30 degrees, so about half.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.31,0:05:08.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}30度的话 大概用一半的力就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.35,0:05:10.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Exactly half.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.35,0:05:10.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}确切说就是一半的力气
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.44,0:05:13.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Exactly half.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.44,0:05:13.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是一半的力气
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.10,0:05:16.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's push.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.10,0:05:16.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来推吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:19.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.98,0:05:19.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:21.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, it's moving. This is easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:21.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瞧 它在动 很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.90,0:05:23.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's all in the math.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.90,0:05:23.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一切都是数学原理
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.16,0:05:27.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What's your formula for the corner? -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.16,0:05:27.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那转角的公式是什么？ -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.45,0:05:31.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.45,0:05:31.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:36.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, yeah, no problem. Just come up here, help me pull and turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.08,0:05:36.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 没问题 你上来帮我拽过去就好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.05,0:05:44.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, gravity, thou art a heatless bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.05,0:05:44.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}重力啊 你是最无情的贱人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.97,0:05:48.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You do understand that our efforts here...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.97,0:05:48.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你明白我们的努力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.01,0:05:52.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...will in no way increase the odds of you having sexual congress with this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.01,0:05:52.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}绝对不会增加你跟那个女人做爱的几率吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.02,0:05:55.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Men do things for women without expecting sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.02,0:05:55.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}男人为女人做事 不该想着女人以性爱当回报
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.73,0:05:58.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, those would be men who just had sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.73,0:05:58.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗯 那是对于做过爱的男人来说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.40,0:06:01.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm doing this to be a good neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.40,0:06:01.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我这么做是想当个好邻居
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.40,0:06:05.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In any case, there's no way it could lower the odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.40,0:06:05.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且 这么做绝对不会降低几率
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.83,0:06:09.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.83,0:06:09.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就要到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:11.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:11.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就要到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.70,0:06:13.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Almost there. SHELDON: No, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.70,0:06:13.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就要到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:16.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No, we're not. No, we're not. -I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:16.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不 还没有… -对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.96,0:06:18.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Watch your fingers. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.96,0:06:18.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-小心手指 -好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:21.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God, my fingers!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:21.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}老天 我的手指！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:24.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You okay? -No, it hurt--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:24.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你没事吧？ -有事 好痛…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.88,0:06:28.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great Caesar's ghost, look at this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.88,0:06:28.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天哪 看看这个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:31.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So Penny is a little messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:31.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮的房间是有点凌乱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.31,0:06:33.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A little messy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.31,0:06:33.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有点凌乱？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.14,0:06:36.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Mandelbrot set of complex numbers is a little messy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.14,0:06:36.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}复数的曼德博集合才叫有点凌乱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.23,0:06:37.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.23,0:06:37.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这里就是混乱
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:39.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.52,0:06:39.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.65,0:06:41.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Explain to me a system...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.65,0:06:41.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能跟我解释一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.11,0:06:44.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...where a tray of flatware on a couch is valid?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.11,0:06:44.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}餐具盒放在沙发上这种组织系统合理吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.45,0:06:46.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just inferring that this is a couch...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.45,0:06:46.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的意思是 这是个沙发
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.57,0:06:50.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because the evidence suggests the coffee table's having a tiny garage sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.57,0:06:50.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为各种迹象表明 咖啡桌上好像在进行小型旧货出售
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.41,0:06:54.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did it occur to you that not everyone has the compulsive need to sort...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.41,0:06:54.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有没有想过不是所有人都有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.92,0:06:57.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...organize and label the entire world around them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.92,0:06:57.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}整理并在所有东西上贴标签的冲动？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.25,0:07:00.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.25,0:07:00.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.84,0:07:02.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.84,0:07:02.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是人人都有的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.21,0:07:03.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hard as it may be to believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.21,0:07:03.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你或许难以相信
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.84,0:07:08.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...most people don't sort their breakfast cereal numerically by fiber content.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.84,0:07:08.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但多数人不会根据纤维量 对他们的早餐麦片进行归类
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.89,0:07:12.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Excuse me, but I think we've both found that helpful at times.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.89,0:07:12.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉 但我认为 我们有时候都会觉得这么做很有用
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.98,0:07:17.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Come on, we should go. -Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.98,0:07:17.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-快 我们走吧 -等等
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.52,0:07:21.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What are you doing? -I'm straightening up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.52,0:07:21.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你干嘛？ -整理一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.61,0:07:23.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, this is not your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.61,0:07:23.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 这不是你家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:27.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is not anyone's home. This is a swirling vortex of entropy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:27.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这根本不叫家 这是无序状态的旋涡中心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.16,0:07:32.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}When the transvestite lived here, you didn't care how he kept the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.16,0:07:32.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个异装癖住这里的时候 你也没关心他家里是什么样子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:34.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because it was immaculate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.66,0:07:34.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为他把家里收拾得很完美
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.04,0:07:36.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, you open that man's closet...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.04,0:07:36.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一打开那个男人的衣橱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:41.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...it was left to right, evening gowns, cocktail dresses and his police uniforms.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.21,0:07:41.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}从左到右 分别是女士晚礼服 酒会礼服和他的警察制服
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.09,0:07:46.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-What were you doing in his closet? -I helped him run some cable for a webcam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.09,0:07:46.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你去他衣橱里做什么？ -我帮他调试摄像头网线
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.05,0:07:48.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hey, guys. -Oh, hey, Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.05,0:07:48.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-嘿 你们好 -嘿 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:50.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This just arrived. Brought this up. Just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.01,0:07:50.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}家具刚到 我们刚搬上来 刚刚好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:52.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great. Was it hard getting up the stairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:52.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好极了 你们搬上来应该费了不少劲吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:54.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -No?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:54.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不费劲 -不费劲？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.02,0:07:57.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No. -No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.02,0:07:57.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-不费劲 -不费劲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.85,0:08:00.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-We'll get out of your hair. -Okay, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.85,0:08:00.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们马上走 -好的 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.02,0:08:02.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.02,0:08:02.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再次谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:05.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.40,0:08:05.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:08.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just want you to know that you don't have to live like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:08.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是想告诉你 你不必过这样的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.74,0:08:11.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.74,0:08:11.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会帮你的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.20,0:08:15.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.20,0:08:15.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.45,0:08:17.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It's a joke. -I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.45,0:08:17.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-那是在开玩笑 -我听不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.96,0:08:19.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, he didn't tell it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.96,0:08:19.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 因为他没有说好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.21,0:08:25.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR OPENS AND CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.36,0:08:46.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.36,0:08:46.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.86,0:08:50.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.86,0:08:50.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.14,0:09:14.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-[WHISPERING] Sheldon? -Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.14,0:09:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.76,0:09:17.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[WHISPERING] Penny's sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.76,0:09:17.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮在睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.77,0:09:21.14,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.77,0:09:21.14,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你疯了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.14,0:09:24.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can't break into a woman's apartment in the middle of the night and clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.14,0:09:24.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不能半夜闯进女人的公寓帮她打扫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.86,0:09:26.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.86,0:09:26.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我控制不了自己
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.11,0:09:29.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I couldn't sleep knowing that just outside my bedroom was our living room...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.11,0:09:29.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我睡不着 知道我的卧室外面是我们的客厅
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.78,0:09:32.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and outside our living room was that hallway...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.78,0:09:32.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们的客厅外面是走廊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.24,0:09:35.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and immediately adjacent to that hallway was this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.24,0:09:35.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}走廊隔壁就是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:38.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you realize that if Penny wakes up...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:38.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道如果佩妮醒过来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.87,0:09:41.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...there is no reasonable explanation as to why we're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.87,0:09:41.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们将无法合理解释为什么我们会在这里吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:44.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just gave you a reasonable explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.12,0:09:44.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我刚刚给了你合理解释
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.29,0:09:47.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. You gave me an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.29,0:09:47.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 你只给了我一个解释
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:51.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Its reasonableness will be determined by a jury of your peers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.75,0:09:51.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你的陪审员朋友会决定它合不合理
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.72,0:09:54.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't be ridiculous. I have no peers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.72,0:09:54.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别闹了 我没有朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:56.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sheldon, we have to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢尔顿 我们得离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:58.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PENNY SNORING]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.93,0:10:02.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You might want to speak in a lower register.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.93,0:10:02.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许你的声音该低沉一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.10,0:10:04.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.10,0:10:04.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:08.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Evolution has made women sensitive to high-pitch noises while they sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.73,0:10:08.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}进化让女人在睡觉时对高音频声音非常敏感
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.36,0:10:10.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so that they'll be roused by a crying baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.36,0:10:10.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}所以她们才能在睡梦里听到婴儿哭泣的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.65,0:10:14.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you want to avoid waking her, speak in a lower register.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.65,0:10:14.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你不想吵醒她 声音放低沉一点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.74,0:10:17.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.74,0:10:17.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那太可笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.16,0:10:18.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[PENNY SNORES]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:25.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IN DEEP VOICE] No, that's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 那太可笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.25,0:10:29.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[IN DEEP VOICE] Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.25,0:10:29.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.34,0:10:33.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I accept your premise. Now, please let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.34,0:10:33.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我赞成你的假设 拜托 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.30,0:10:36.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-I'm not leaving until I'm done. -Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.30,0:10:36.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没弄好我绝对不走 -不
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.85,0:10:43.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you have time to lean, you have time to clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.85,0:10:43.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}有时间靠在那 就有时间打扫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:49.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, what the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:49.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真糟心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.94,0:10:54.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[HUMMING]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.74,0:10:57.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.74,0:10:57.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:10:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.32,0:10:59.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}早
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:02.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have to say I slept splendidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:02.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得说我睡得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.58,0:11:05.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Granted not long, but just deeply and well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.58,0:11:05.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然睡眠时间不多 但睡得很熟
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.96,0:11:07.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.96,0:11:07.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我一点都不惊讶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.21,0:11:09.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A well-known folk cure for insomnia...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.21,0:11:09.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}治疗失眠非常有效的传统疗法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.13,0:11:12.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is to break into your neighbor's apartment and clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.13,0:11:12.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是溜到邻居家打扫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.80,0:11:14.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sarcasm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.80,0:11:14.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是讽刺吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.63,0:11:16.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.63,0:11:16.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:19.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Granted, my methods may have been somewhat unorthodox...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:19.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错 或许我的做法有点非正统
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.26,0:11:22.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but the end result will be a measurable enhancement...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.26,0:11:22.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但结果可以大大地提升
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:24.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...to Penny's quality of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:24.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮的生活品质
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.14,0:11:27.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You've convinced me, maybe we should sneak in and shampoo her carpet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.14,0:11:27.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你这么说很有道理 或许我们今晚该溜进去帮她洗地毯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.81,0:11:30.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-You don't think that crosses a line? -Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.81,0:11:30.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-你不觉得那太过分了吗？ -对
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.90,0:11:32.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For God's sake, Sheldon...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.90,0:11:32.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:36.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...do I have to hold up a sarcasm sign every time I open my mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:36.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我每次开口说话 都得高举写着“讽刺”的牌子吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.49,0:11:39.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You have a sarcasm sign?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.49,0:11:39.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你有写着“讽刺”的牌子？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.12,0:11:43.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I do not have a sarcasm sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.12,0:11:43.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不 我没有写着“讽刺”的牌子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:45.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You want some cereal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:45.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你要吃早餐麦片吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:49.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I feel so good today, I'm gonna choose from the low-fiber end of the shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:49.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今天我感觉棒极了 我要从低纤维的那边开始选
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:51.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello, Honey Puffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:51.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你好 蜂蜜泡芙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:53.75,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:53.75,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}狗娘养的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:56.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:56.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮起床了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.51,0:11:59.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: You sick, geeky bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.51,0:11:59.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们这些变态呆瓜混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.51,0:12:02.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How did she know it was us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.51,0:12:02.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她怎么知道是我们？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.60,0:12:06.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I may have left a suggested organizational schematic...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.60,0:12:06.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我留了一份建议组织表
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.31,0:12:08.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...for her bedroom closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.31,0:12:08.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}给她的卧室衣橱使用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:09.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PENNY: Leonard?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:09.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.35,0:12:10.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This is gonna be bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.35,0:12:10.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大事不妙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.65,0:12:14.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Goodbye, Honey Puffs. Hello, Big Bran.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.65,0:12:14.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再见 蜂蜜泡芙 你好 全谷物口味
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.23,0:12:16.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You came into my apartment while I was sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.23,0:12:16.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你趁我睡觉时跑到我家？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.74,0:12:18.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, but only to clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.74,0:12:18.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对 但我是去打扫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.07,0:12:21.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really more to organize, you're not actually dirty, per se.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.07,0:12:21.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}应该是说将东西摆好 事实上你不是个脏乱差的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:23.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Give me back my key.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:23.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把钥匙还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.70,0:12:25.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm very, very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.70,0:12:25.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.08,0:12:28.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you understand how creepy this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.08,0:12:28.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道这有多恐怖吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.33,0:12:30.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, we discussed it at length last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.33,0:12:30.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}知道 昨晚我们谈了很久
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:33.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In my apartment? While I was sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.54,0:12:33.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在我的公寓里 趁我睡觉时？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:36.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And snoring. And that's probably just a sinus infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.21,0:12:36.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有打呼时 或许只是鼻窦炎的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.38,0:12:40.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But it could be sleep apnea. You might wanna see an otorhinolaryngologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.38,0:12:40.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也可能是睡眠呼吸中止症 你该去看耳鼻喉科医生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.64,0:12:44.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The throat doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.64,0:12:44.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}治疗喉咙的医生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.60,0:12:49.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And what kind of doctor removes shoes from asses?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.60,0:12:49.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么样的医生会治疗混蛋？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.94,0:12:51.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Depending on the depth...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.94,0:12:51.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那得视问题的严重度而定
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.27,0:12:56.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that's either a proctologist, or a general surgeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.27,0:12:56.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}直肠科医生或一般外科都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.98,0:12:58.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}（讽刺）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.24,0:13:05.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.62,0:13:07.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-God! -Okay, look. No, Penny--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.62,0:13:07.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-天啊！ -听我说 不 佩妮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.29,0:13:10.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think what you're feeling is valid and maybe later today...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.29,0:13:10.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你有权利生气 或许过一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.33,0:13:13.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...when you're feeling less, for lack of a better word, violated...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.33,0:13:13.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当你觉得…我找不到其他的形容词… 比较没有被侵犯的感觉时
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.71,0:13:15.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...maybe we can talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.71,0:13:15.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我们可以谈一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:18.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Stay away from me. -Sure. That's another way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:18.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-离我远一点 -当然 那也是个好方法
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.05,0:13:20.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Penny, Penny, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.05,0:13:20.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}佩妮 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.26,0:13:21.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just to clarify...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.26,0:13:21.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只想弄清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.76,0:13:25.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...because there will be a discussion when you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.76,0:13:25.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为你离开后我们会讨论
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.80,0:13:29.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is your objection solely to our presence in the apartment while you were sleeping...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.80,0:13:29.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你生气是因为我们趁你睡觉时溜到你家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.93,0:13:34.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...or do you also object to the imposition of a new organizational paradigm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.93,0:13:34.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是你不喜欢我提供的新排列方式呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.74,0:13:40.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DOOR SLAMS]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.74,0:13:43.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她的反应不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.99,0:13:43.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, that was a little non-responsive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.45,0:13:47.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You are going to march yourself over there right now and apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.45,0:13:47.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该马上过去道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.08,0:13:48.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[SHELDON LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:53.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:53.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么事那么好笑？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.25,0:13:55.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That wasn't sarcasm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.25,0:13:55.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不是讽刺吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.63,0:13:57.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-No! -Whoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.63,0:13:57.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不是！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.29,0:14:00.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boy, you are all over the place this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.29,0:14:00.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 今天早上你火气真大
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:07.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have a Master's and two Ph.Ds. I should not have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.88,0:14:07.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我有一个硕士学位跟两个博士学位 我不该这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.06,0:14:09.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.06,0:14:09.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:12.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm truly sorry for what happened last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:12.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}关于昨晚的事我非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.14,0:14:14.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I take full responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.14,0:14:14.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我愿意负起全责
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.14,0:14:16.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hope that it won't color your opinion of Leonard...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.14,0:14:16.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我希望那不会影响到你对莱纳德的看法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.90,0:14:23.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...who is not only a wonderful guy, but also, I hear, a gentle and thorough lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.90,0:14:23.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他不只是个好人 我听说他也是温柔体贴的情人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.87,0:14:37.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I did what I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.87,0:14:37.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经尽力了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:43.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Raj.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.17,0:14:43.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 拉吉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.60,0:14:51.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, I don't know if you heard about what happened with Leonard and Sheldon...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.60,0:14:51.43,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嘿 我不知道你有没有听说 莱纳德和谢尔顿昨晚干的好事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:53.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but I'm really upset about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.52,0:14:53.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我真的很生气
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.35,0:14:56.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, they let themselves into my place, and then they cleaned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.35,0:14:56.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们溜进我家打扫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.69,0:14:59.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you even believe that? How weird is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.69,0:14:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能相信吗？那真的很怪吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.65,0:15:02.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}RAJESH [IN VOICE-OVER]: She's standing very close to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.65,0:15:02.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她站得离我好近
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:04.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my. She does smell good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.48,0:15:04.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊 她真的好香
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.70,0:15:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is that? Vanilla?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.70,0:15:07.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是什么味道？香草吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:08.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:08.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.57,0:15:11.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where I come from, someone comes into your house at night, you shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.57,0:15:11.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}在我的老家 半夜有人闯进你家 你可以开枪的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.74,0:15:13.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay? And you don't shoot to wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.74,0:15:13.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吗？你开枪不是为了击伤
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:18.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, all right, my sister shot her husband, but it was an accident, they were drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:18.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 我姐姐对她老公开枪 但那是意外 他们喝醉了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.04,0:15:20.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What was I saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.04,0:15:20.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.75,0:15:22.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's so chatty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.75,0:15:22.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她真的话很多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.55,0:15:27.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe my parents were right. Maybe I'd be better off with an Indian girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.55,0:15:27.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许我爸妈是对的 我该跟印度女孩交往
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:29.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We'd have the same cultural background...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:29.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们有相同的文化背景
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.39,0:15:32.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and my wife could sing to my children the lullabies my mother sang to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.39,0:15:32.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我妻子可以给我的孩子唱我妈妈对我唱过的摇篮曲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.06,0:15:34.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's obvious they meant well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.06,0:15:34.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道他们是好心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:36.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm having a really rough time. Like I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:36.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是我正处于低潮期
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.89,0:15:39.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I broke up with my boyfriend and it's freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.89,0:15:39.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我跟我男朋友分手 那让我很痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.52,0:15:41.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[RAJESH SINGING IN FOREIGN LANGUAGE IN VOICE-OVER]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:47.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, just because most of the men I've known happened to be jerks...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.94,0:15:47.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就因为我认识的男人大多数都是混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.53,0:15:50.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...doesn't mean I should just assume Leonard and Sheldon are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.53,0:15:50.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不代表我该觉得莱纳德和谢尔顿也是混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:52.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.70,0:15:52.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:55.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She asked me a question. I should probably nod.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.20,0:15:55.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她问我问题 或许我该点头
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:15:58.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's exactly what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:15:58.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也那么想
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:16:01.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you for listening. You're a doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.62,0:16:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你的倾听 你人真好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.59,0:16:05.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh-oh. Turn your pelvis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.59,0:16:05.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}将骨盆移开
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.05,0:16:10.43,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}[DANCE MUSIC PLAYS ON TV]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.77,0:16:22.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Grab a napkin, homey, you just got served.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.77,0:16:22.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拿纸巾过来 朋友 你刚得到享受了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.11,0:16:25.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's fine. You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.11,0:16:25.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没关系 你赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.44,0:16:28.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's his problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.44,0:16:28.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.11,0:16:31.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}His imaginary girlfriend broke up with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.11,0:16:31.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他想象中的女朋友跟他分手了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:35.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:35.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我能感同身受
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.12,0:16:38.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.12,0:16:38.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:42.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sorry I'm late, but I was in the hallway, chatting up Penny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:42.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉我迟到了 刚刚我在走廊跟佩妮聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.38,0:16:43.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? You?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.38,0:16:43.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的？你？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.75,0:16:45.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Rajesh Koothrappali spoke to Penny?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.75,0:16:45.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拉吉希库萨帕里跟佩妮说话？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.17,0:16:49.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, I was less the chatter than the chattee.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.17,0:16:49.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上我是只听不说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.47,0:16:51.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What did she say? Is she still mad at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.47,0:16:51.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她说了什么？她还在生我的气吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.68,0:16:53.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, she was upset at first...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.68,0:16:53.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一开始她很生气
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.30,0:16:56.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...but probably because her sister shot somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.30,0:16:56.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但或许因为她姐姐对某人开枪…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.18,0:17:02.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then there was something about you, and then she hugged me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.18,0:17:02.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然后她提到你 后来她抱了我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.19,0:17:05.65,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She hugged you? How did she hug you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.19,0:17:05.65,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她抱了你？她是怎么抱你的？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.36,0:17:15.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Is that her perfume I smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.36,0:17:15.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是她的香水味吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:19.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Intoxicating, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.16,0:17:19.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很醉人的香味吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.64,0:17:38.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hi. -Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.64,0:17:38.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.97,0:17:40.10,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.97,0:17:40.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.10,0:17:42.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Uh....
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.39,0:17:44.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here's the thing:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.39,0:17:44.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:54.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Penny, just as Oppenheimer came to regret his contributions to the first atomic bomb...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:54.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}“佩妮 就像奥本海默后悔 他对第一颗原子弹做出的贡献一样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.62,0:17:56.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...so too I regret my participation in what was...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.62,0:17:56.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也很后悔参与
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.03,0:17:59.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...at the very least, an error in judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.03,0:17:59.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个错误的判断
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.87,0:18:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The hallmark of the great human experiment...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.87,0:18:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}伟大人性实验的标志
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:05.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...is the willingness to recognize one's mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.21,0:18:05.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就是我们愿意承认自己的错误
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.63,0:18:09.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Madam Curie's discovery of radium turned out to have great potential...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.63,0:18:09.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}譬如居里夫人发现镭 结果它的潜力无穷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.55,0:18:13.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...even though she would later die a slow, painful death from radiation poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.55,0:18:13.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然她后来因为镭中毒慢慢地痛苦死去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.55,0:18:18.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Another example, from the field of Ebola research--"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.55,0:18:18.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}另一个例子来自埃博拉病毒的研究…”
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.35,0:18:19.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.35,0:18:19.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.06,0:18:21.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.06,0:18:21.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.98,0:18:25.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}We're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.98,0:18:25.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:47.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}LEONARD: Six two-inch dowels? -Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:47.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-六根五公分的暗销？ -有了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:49.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-One package Philips head screws? -Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:49.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-一包十字螺丝？ -有了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.50,0:18:51.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Guys, seriously, I grew up on a farm, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.50,0:18:51.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 说真的 我是在农场长大的 好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.63,0:18:54.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I rebuilt a tractor engine when I was, like, 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.63,0:18:54.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我十二岁时就会重组拖拉机引擎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.01,0:18:56.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think I can put together a cheap Swedish media center.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.01,0:18:56.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我会组合便宜的瑞典多媒体播放柜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.76,0:18:59.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please, we insist. It's the least we can do, considering--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.76,0:18:59.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托 我们很坚持 这是我们该做的 毕竟…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:01.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Considering what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.76,0:19:01.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}毕竟什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.02,0:19:03.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How great this place looks?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.02,0:19:03.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个地方看起来有多棒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.23,0:19:06.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Oh, boy, I was afraid of this. -What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.23,0:19:06.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-天啊 我就是担心这个 -什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.81,0:19:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}These instructions are a pictographic representation...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.81,0:19:09.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些图解是组合这些零件
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.48,0:19:12.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...of the least imaginative way to assemble these components.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.48,0:19:12.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}最没有想象力的说明
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.48,0:19:15.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}This right here is why Sweden has no space program.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.48,0:19:15.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这最好的证明了为何瑞典人没有太空计划
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.70,0:19:19.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-It looked pretty good in the store. -It is an inefficient design.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.70,0:19:19.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-在店里看起来很不错 -这是没有效率的设计
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.87,0:19:21.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}For example, Penny has a flat-screen TV...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.87,0:19:23.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}例如佩妮有平面电视 也就是说后面的空间都浪费了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:23.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...which means all this space behind it is wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.91,0:19:26.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-We could put her stereo back there. -And control it how?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.91,0:19:26.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我们可以将她的音响放在后面 -要如何操作它呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.71,0:19:31.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Run an infrared repeater, photocell here, emitter here, easy-peasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.71,0:19:31.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}用红外线中继器 这里放光电池 这里放发射器 很简单的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.67,0:19:34.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Good point. How will you cool it? -Guys, I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.67,0:19:34.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-说得好 那要怎么冷却？ -各位 我可以处理的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.26,0:19:36.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Hang on, Penny. -How about fans?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.26,0:19:36.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-等一下 佩妮 -风扇呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.59,0:19:40.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Here and here. -Also inefficient, and might be loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.59,0:19:40.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-这里跟这里 -但效率不高 可能会很吵
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.18,0:19:42.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How about a liquid cooler? A little aquarium pump here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.18,0:19:42.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}液体冷却器呢？这里装个小水族箱水泵
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.89,0:19:44.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Run some quarter-inch PVC--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.89,0:19:44.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}装上0,6公分的塑胶管…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.47,0:19:46.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Guys, this is actually really simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.47,0:19:46.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 这真的很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.02,0:19:48.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hold on, honey, men at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.02,0:19:48.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下 亲爱的 男人在办正事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.06,0:19:54.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}PVC comes here. Maybe a little corrugated sheet metal as a radiator here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.06,0:19:54.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}塑胶管穿过这里 在这里装波纹金属板来散热
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.69,0:19:58.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Show me where we put a drip tray, a sluice and a overflow reservoir?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.69,0:19:58.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}告诉我滴盘、斜水槽跟溢流水箱该放在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.32,0:20:01.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If water's involved, we'll ground the crap out of the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.32,0:20:01.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果真的要用到水 我们得把它接到地面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.41,0:20:05.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Guys, it's hot in here. I think I'll just take off all my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.41,0:20:05.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}各位 这里好热 我想脱光衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:11.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:11.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:17.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What if we replaced panels A, B and F and crossbar H with aircraft-grade aluminum?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:17.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果将A、B、F杆及横杆H拿掉 用飞机级的铝板来取代呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.47,0:20:19.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Entire thing's one big heat sink. -Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.47,0:20:19.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-它一定会是个很炫的散热器 -超完美
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:23.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Leonard and Sheldon, go to the junkyard and pick up 6 square meters of aluminum.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:23.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莱纳德跟谢尔顿到垃圾场找一块六平方米大的铝板
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.56,0:20:26.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Raj and I will get the oxyacetylene torch. -Meet in an hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.56,0:20:26.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-拉吉跟我去拿氧炔焊炬 -一小时后见？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.52,0:20:28.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-Done. -Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.52,0:20:28.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-没问题 -了解
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.15,0:20:33.73,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, this place does look pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.15,0:20:33.73,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧 这里的确看起来很不错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.72,0:21:02.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}译者： 吴春燕
